# Ignore everything
*

# But allow these
!src/
!src/**
!tests/
!tests/**
!*.md
!Makefile
!CMakeLists.txt
!.clang-format
!*.sh
!LICENSE
!screenshots/
!screenshots/*.png
!*.png


!designs/
!designs/**
!docs/
!docs/**
!images/
!images/**

# Cursor agent rules and skills (canonical; .agents/ symlinks here)
!.cursor/
!.cursor/rules/
!.cursor/rules/**
!.cursor/skills/
!.cursor/skills/**

# .agents/ entry points (symlinks to .cursor/) + portable workflow plans
!.agents/
!.agents/rules
!.agents/skills
!.agents/workflows/
!.agents/workflows/**

# Grok Build workflow templates
!.grok/
!.grok/workflows/
!.grok/workflows/**

# GitHub Actions (must un-ignore parent dirs for git to descend)
!.github/
!.github/workflows/
!.github/workflows/**

# AI / stellarfusion state (never commit - contains fused project knowledge)
.stellarfusion/